<title>NETHERLANDS: Stork says in talks to relaunch Fokker.</title>
<headline>Stork says in talks to relaunch Fokker.</headline>
<dateline>NAARDEN, Netherlands 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch industrial systems and services group Stork NV confirmed on Thursday it was in discussions over a possible relaunch of bankrupt Dutch planemaker Fokker.</p>
<p>&quot;We are involved in negotiations over a possible relaunch,&quot; a Stork spokesman said. Stork acquired Fokker's profitable maintenance and aircraft component operations last year.</p>
</text>
